{"id":"e1107f30","type":"testimonials","label":"Client testimonials","html":"<section class=\"cmp cmp-testimonials section\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"cmp-testimonials__head\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Testimonials</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Real First Impressions. Real Results.</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Hear from our clients about working with Zoot Web Agency and the measurable results we helped them achieve.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cmp-testimonials__grid\">\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>We hired Zoot web agency for Google My Business SEO services and the results have been outstanding. Our local visibility improved quickly, our listing is now optimized correctly, and we’re getting more calls and in-store traffic than before. They clearly understand local SEO, maps ranking, reviews, and how to position a business to stand out in competitive searches. Communication was clear, expectations were realistic, and delivery exceeded what was promised. Highly recommend their GMB SEO services to any business serious about local growth.</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">B</span>brainbodge</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>I’ve now worked with many other agencies but this one absolutely delivered what I was looking for. The citations they completed were incredibly detailed, accurate, and clearly done with a deep understanding of what actually moves the needle. What really stands out is how much he goes above and beyond, not just doing the job, but making sure everything is set up properly for long-term results. Even from the first order, the level of depth and care was impressive, and this second order just reinforced that. Communication is always smooth, turnaround is reliable, and the quality is consistently high. I’ll definitely continue ordering and look forward to working with him long-term!</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">E</span>Englishcoach</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>Zoot Web Agency has been Exceptional in helping us with SEO across all of our clinics, i am deeply content on the direction we are taking as citations are much underrated by many business owners. AI signaling in diffrent ways is replacing the outdated old SEO and I am glad I am working with Prasad to maintain modern visibility online.</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">S</span>Scubaskool</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>Zoot did an excellent job improving our SEO and online visibility. They built high-quality backlinks, optimized our map citations, and helped strengthen our local search presence. Their work was professional, effective, and clearly driven by real expertise. What impressed me most was that he went beyond the agreed work by adding extra improvements and giving valuable SEO advice for free. They are knowledgeable, proactive, and genuinely cares about delivering results. I highly recommend them to anyone looking for reliable SEO and backlink services</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">K</span>karlblud</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>After trying several top rated agency, i can surely say they is outstanding. Dont even look furher, hire them they has an excellent and in-depth understanding of webpage SEO and explains clearly how everything connects to Google. They breaks down what backlinks are created, where they lead, and how they strengthen your online presence. They communicates in a very transparent and structured way and puts real effort into choosing the best strategy for your project. Highly recommended.</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">R</span>Revibetherapy</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure class=\"card\">\n        <img class=\"cmp-testimonials__stars\" src=\"https://zootwebagency.com/uploads/2026/05/icon-five-stars.svg?dpl=dpl_5T2BU7UNNuondXuXiGnhzzGeNHdu\" alt=\"Five stars\">\n        <blockquote>I had a great experience working with this SEO service. They helped improve my Google Business ranking and increased visibility for my towing company. Very professional, honest, and knowledgeable about local SEO. I started seeing better results on Google Maps and more customer calls after their work. Communication was excellent and they explained everything clearly. I highly recommend them to anyone looking to grow their business online. Great job and thank you for the amazing service!</blockquote>\n        <figcaption><span class=\"cmp-testimonials__av\">K</span>Kalsaid16</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <style>\n    .cmp-testimonials .cmp-testimonials__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 40px}\n    .cmp-testimonials .cmp-testimonials__head > * + *{margin-top:10px}\n    .cmp-testimonials .cmp-testimonials__grid{columns:3 300px;column-gap:20px}\n    .cmp-testimonials figure.card{margin:0 0 20px;break-inside:avoid;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}\n    .cmp-testimonials .cmp-testimonials__stars{height:18px;width:auto;align-self:flex-start}\n    .cmp-testimonials blockquote{margin:0;line-height:1.65;font-size:.97rem}\n    .cmp-testimonials figcaption{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:700;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}\n    .cmp-testimonials .cmp-testimonials__av{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-contrast);font-size:.9rem}\n  </style>\n</section>","sourceUrl":"https://zootwebagency.com/","createdAt":"2026-10-17T07:19:35.275Z"}